It's hard to say, but we've made a lot of progress in the last year. I don't expect us to slow down - things are just getting fun and exciting:
Quoting @tristanbiesecke
@clattner_llvm congrats on the recent Modular announcement! I’m very interested in Mojo🔥 as a general purpose programming language, and I noticed a few mentions of this in the docs for the future. Realistically, how long do you think it would take Mojo🔥 to get there?

Any instance of Mojo is for a specific homogenous compute target, but the particularly interesting app is when you mix in the modular ai engine to orchestrate the heterogenous compute layer across multiple diverse devices 🤯. Stay tuned for more details later this year. 🔥
